(The final step is to use what has been noticed. Reading a passage aloud) Tj T*
(reveals its rhythm: content words carry the stress, while small function) Tj T*
(words shrink and link together. Shadowing a good speaker, phrase by phrase,) Tj T*
(turns silent knowledge into something the mouth can actually produce.) Tj T*
T*
(Admittedly, this takes patience. Nevertheless, a single page read slowly) Tj T*
(may teach more than a whole chapter devoured in haste.) Tj T*
ET
